WEBVTT

00:00:14.370 --> 00:00:15.620
It’s delicious.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:17.410
I made another great dish.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.420
Mornin’.

00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:25.670
Oh, good morning, Ryo-sama!

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:27.710
It’s really cold today, isn’t it?

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:29.670
Maybe it’ll snow.

00:00:38.060 --> 00:00:39.730
Good morning, Shizuka-chan.

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:43.060
Oh? Did you catch a cold?

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:44.980
What?! Are you feeling okay, Akane?

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:46.110
I’m fine.

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:47.820
I’m just feeling a bit tired…

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:50.240
Akane!

00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:51.530
Akane-san!

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:08.970
So I don’t spill my wish from my eyes,

00:01:09.760 --> 00:01:15.830
I want to make my heart race to you.

00:01:17.140 --> 00:01:23.190
I put my feelings on this palette of endearment

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:28.820
and paint them on my heart.

00:01:29.780 --> 00:01:31.780
The sweetness

00:01:32.900 --> 00:01:36.870
and the strength you gave are sitting back to back.

00:01:36.870 --> 00:01:38.330
The time

00:01:40.040 --> 00:01:44.710
is drawing bells in the sky.

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:52.840
Colorful assortments of balloons of dreams

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:54.730
float in the wind,

00:01:54.730 --> 00:01:56.610
flowing toward you,

00:01:56.610 --> 00:02:00.080
freely.

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:06.900
I’m happy that I found destiny.

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:10.530
It’s filling with colors.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:15.530
An “Ah~n” for
Love and Reminiscence
A Great Fever!!

00:02:24.830 --> 00:02:26.830
Don’t sulk just because we have to stay home today.

00:02:27.330 --> 00:02:28.700
But…

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:32.250
Anyways, you should at least
eat your dinner.

00:02:32.920 --> 00:02:34.500
Here, go ah~n.

00:02:45.310 --> 00:02:47.440
Look, this problem is just an extension of last week’s.

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:53.400
If a line is drawn here,
it makes two triangles, right?

00:02:53.400 --> 00:02:56.290
Then, if you figure out the areas of both triangles and add those two together,

00:02:56.290 --> 00:02:57.440
you have the answer.

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.870
Poor kids.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:14.590
They’re both in elementary school, right?

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.340
I heard that Haruki is going to look after them now.

00:03:16.920 --> 00:03:19.670
Since he’s still pretty young, is that wise?

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:25.140
But Akane-chan insists that she wants to stay with her brother.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:28.430
I could only take in one of them.

00:03:28.430 --> 00:03:30.060
So that’s why Haruki is taking them in.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:30.620
Yes.

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:37.810
Brother…

00:03:42.700 --> 00:03:43.910
Wait…

00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:45.200
Where are you going?

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:46.090
Brother?

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:47.660
Brother!

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:49.910
Brother!!

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:52.760
Brother!

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.300
Oh yeah…

00:04:02.810 --> 00:04:04.010
I…

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:13.100
She’s fine.

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:15.730
It’s just a cold.

00:04:17.150 --> 00:04:18.020
But what if…

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:21.440
What’s wrong, Mizuhara?

00:04:21.440 --> 00:04:24.660
Akane-sama caught a cold.

00:04:24.660 --> 00:04:28.200
From the way he is acting, I would expect it to be a bigger deal then that.

00:04:28.200 --> 00:04:31.080
Ryo is always like this when it concerns Kane-chan.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.040
Let him be.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.090
This brother really cares for his sister.

00:04:34.500 --> 00:04:39.590
If only Ryo-sama were sick,
instead of Akane…

00:04:40.210 --> 00:04:43.360
I’d nurse him back to health!

00:04:44.620 --> 00:04:47.600
Shizuka… Shizuka!

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:52.600
Coming, Ryo-sama! Have you taken your medicine yet?

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:57.520
Once your fever goes down,
let’s have a meal together.

00:05:00.850 --> 00:05:02.530
Okay, Ryo-sama…

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:06.870
Wow! It’s too good!

00:05:07.590 --> 00:05:09.910
Thank you for taking such good care of me.

00:05:10.380 --> 00:05:15.420
It’s opened my eyes to let them see your true charms, Shizuka!

00:05:16.010 --> 00:05:17.810
Let’s get married, Shizuka!

00:05:17.810 --> 00:05:19.260
Ryo-sama…

00:05:20.160 --> 00:05:23.490
It could happen, it could happen!

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:26.400
She seems sadistically happy.

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:28.390
We’ll have to leave them be.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:31.680
Maybe she got sick because you made her worry too much.

00:05:32.550 --> 00:05:33.760
It’s my fault?!

00:05:33.760 --> 00:05:38.230
Things have been pretty hectic recently with Shizuka around and everything.

00:05:38.230 --> 00:05:39.060
But… But…

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.070
Akane!

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:45.070
A! KA! NE!

00:05:55.950 --> 00:05:57.590
This place is…

00:05:58.750 --> 00:06:02.090
so quiet when I’m alone.

00:06:16.470 --> 00:06:20.640
I feel like we are becoming distant.

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:31.700
Akane!

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:47.460
Hm, this is really strange…

00:06:48.760 --> 00:06:50.760
What’s could be going on?

00:06:51.470 --> 00:06:52.600
Could it be?!

00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:01.400
Cough!

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:03.560
Cough! Cough! Cough!

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:09.280
No, that’s impossible!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:15.530
B-Brother!

00:07:16.700 --> 00:07:17.580
Death.

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:19.840
Falling.

00:07:26.840 --> 00:07:29.930
Please, Akane, answer the phone!

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.720
Doesn’t she just have a cold?

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.510
Yes, without a doubt…

00:07:34.510 --> 00:07:37.430
Then, I’ll graciously eat Ryo’s lunch.

00:07:37.960 --> 00:07:39.160
Akane!

00:07:39.160 --> 00:07:42.190
Akane!!

00:07:42.630 --> 00:07:43.600
Hi!

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.730
Long time no see!

00:07:45.730 --> 00:07:48.860
Please open your textbook to page ninety-two.

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:51.110
Oh? Mizuhara-kun is absent?

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.200
Well, um…

00:07:59.830 --> 00:08:02.330
I don’t feel well, so I’m going home early, okay?

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:05.330
T-Take care of yourself, then.

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:13.880
It’s all my fault!

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.990
I’m the one who made her worry!

00:08:15.990 --> 00:08:17.840
And I’m the one who
needs to look after her!

00:08:17.840 --> 00:08:18.810
But… But…

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:21.270
I’m such an idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

00:08:21.270 --> 00:08:21.980
Idiot! Idiot! Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!

00:08:21.980 --> 00:08:23.690
Press button to cross

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.500
This is nothing.

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:45.540
Wait for me, Akane.

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:46.960
I’m coming right now!

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:47.960
Full speed ahead!

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.500
Switch to Mode Three!

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:01.940
It’s still so early.

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:09.270
I feel like time passes slower
when I’m alone.

00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:12.490
Back then…

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:18.860
Look, you need to take your medicine after you eat this, okay?

00:09:18.860 --> 00:09:19.320
Yeah.

00:09:23.020 --> 00:09:24.830
Here, go ah~n.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:30.630
Does it taste good?

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:31.220
Yeah.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:33.250
Then take one more bite.

00:09:46.930 --> 00:09:48.350
B-Brother?!

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:52.650
Akane, are you okay?

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:08.870
Good, your fever is going down.

00:10:08.870 --> 00:10:11.710
Yeah, I feel a lot better…

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:14.460
because you came home.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:15.420
Hmm?

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:17.590
No, it’s nothing.

00:10:17.590 --> 00:10:19.050
You’re such a weirdo.

00:10:19.720 --> 00:10:22.140
Can you at least eat this rice porridge?

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:29.140
Here.

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:32.280
W-What?

00:10:40.530 --> 00:10:41.780
Is it too hot?

00:10:41.780 --> 00:10:42.910
No, it’s fine.

00:10:42.910 --> 00:10:44.450
It’s really good!

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:47.620
Then eat a lot and get better fast.

00:10:47.620 --> 00:10:48.850
Yeah!

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:51.540
It’s the same as it was back then.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:52.460
What is?

00:10:53.840 --> 00:10:55.380
Uh, nothing.

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:57.230
Here, ah~n.

00:10:59.010 --> 00:11:01.350
Such devoted siblings.

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:05.560
This is far more than I’ve ever heard.

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:09.600
Huh? Why are Miki and Ojo here?

00:11:10.180 --> 00:11:12.570
You were acting pretty delusional and crazy this morning,

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:14.690
so we came to see how things are.

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:18.190
Yet, we came to only find
you going “ah~n.”

00:11:18.190 --> 00:11:20.990
Emi-rin, do you want to catch a cold?

00:11:20.990 --> 00:11:22.610
What are you talking about?

00:11:24.160 --> 00:11:28.480
Ryo-sama, I think I have a cold too!

00:11:28.480 --> 00:11:31.000
I feel dizzy.

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:34.750
So, please nurse me too.

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:35.880
Here, ah~n.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:37.480
Damn, don’t open your mouth so eagerly!
Here, ah~n.

00:11:37.480 --> 00:11:39.590
Damn, don’t open your mouth so eagerly!

00:11:39.590 --> 00:11:41.300
You don’t look sick at all!

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:43.840
That’s not fair!

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:46.470
You’re only kind to Akane-san!

00:11:46.930 --> 00:11:49.010
Akane is my sister!

00:11:49.010 --> 00:11:51.220
So of course I would be kind to her!

00:11:51.220 --> 00:11:54.600
But I’m your cute fiancée!

00:11:54.600 --> 00:11:55.440
You’re not cute!

00:11:55.440 --> 00:11:57.270
And you’re not my fiancée!

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:07.950
After all, no matter how old he gets, he’s still Ryo.

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.490
I’m really happy for you, Kane-chan.

00:12:09.490 --> 00:12:12.630
He’ll always care more about his sister than anyone else forever.

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:13.930
To be continued!
To be continued!

00:12:13.930 --> 00:12:14.550
To be continued!

00:12:16.210 --> 00:12:19.250
The moment came

00:12:20.090 --> 00:12:23.250
very much out of the blue.

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:28.390
You showed up right in front of me,

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:31.110
then started to change everything.

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:34.940
If my meeting you

00:12:35.840 --> 00:12:38.790
is not by fate,

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:44.150
there are no miracles,

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:49.340
even if I search all over the world.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:52.730
Embracing love,

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:56.660
kissing love,

00:12:57.410 --> 00:13:00.590
holding love,

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:04.890
I whisper, “I love you.”

00:13:04.890 --> 00:13:08.920
Please look at me and me alone,

00:13:08.920 --> 00:13:12.340
forever.
